<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<!--
  phase-05/plists/com.ohama.kanban-proxy.plist — versioned staging source for
  ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.ohama.kanban-proxy.plist (installed by
  phase-05/services/install_services.sh, brought up only by
  phase-02/infra/restart_service.sh — never hand-loaded).

  STAGED_PLISTS_DIR (phase-05/services/config.env) is the project-wide
  plist staging directory, shared by every phase, so this file lives here
  while the component it describes is owned by Phase 6 — 06-04.1 authored
  it to unblock 06-04's discovery that kanban's own compiled Host allowlist
  rejects the tailnet hostname. This dict must stay plutil-clean and cannot
  itself carry prose, so the non-obvious choices are recorded here:

  - Both CLINE_NO_AUTO_UPDATE and KANBAN_NO_AUTO_UPDATE are set. This is
    not decorative: phase-01/config/check_versions.sh Check C lowercases
    the joined Program/ProgramArguments of every installed plist and, on
    seeing the substring "kanban", REQUIRES both variables. This plist's
    ProgramArguments[1] (the wrapper path) contains "kanban", so omitting
    either one makes phase-01/config/verify_config.sh FAIL the moment this
    plist installs — even though the proxy process itself never invokes
    cline or kanban.
  - EnvironmentVariables.PATH includes /opt/homebrew/bin so `node` is
    reachable — the wrapper execs $NODE_BIN by absolute path already, but
    node's own child-process resolution (none here) and any future need
    both want PATH sane, matching the other two Phase 5 plists' style.
  - StandardOutPath/StandardErrorPath live under ~/.cline/logs/ (the same
    directory the kanban and telegram-connect plists use), NOT
    ~/llm-system/services/logs/ (the other three house services). This
    proxy is deliberately NOT run through run_sandboxed.sh (see
    run_kanban_proxy_service.sh's own header for the full reasoning: its
    source lives under $HOME, unpunched by the sandbox profile, and
    widening EXTRA_ALLOW_PATHS to fix that is forbidden). Even so, this
    plist keeps the ~/.cline/logs/ location: launchd opens these fds
    ITSELF, before exec, regardless of whether the child ends up
    sandboxed, and redirecting stdio at an unpunched path has produced a
    bare SIGABRT five separate times in this project. One log directory
    for every supervised service, and no chance of resurrecting that
    failure just because this one component happens not to be sandboxed.
  - WorkingDirectory is workspace/scratch-repo, the same directory both
    other Phase 5 plists use, created by install_services.sh's Step 2
    before the plist ever lands, so it provably exists. This proxy does
    not read/write any file under it at runtime — it is here only for
    consistency with the other two services' launchd jobs and because
    install_services.sh already guarantees its existence.
  - ThrottleInterval 30 matches THROTTLE_INTERVAL in
    phase-05/services/config.env, inside the house range (10-60s).
  - RunAtLoad true is the reboot-persistence mechanism; KeepAlive true (a
    bare boolean, not a dict) is the crash-recovery mechanism.
  - No wildcard-bind literal appears anywhere in this file. The proxy's
    listen host, KANBAN_PROXY_HOST=127.0.0.1, is set once in
    phase-06/net/config.env and never overridden here — this plist carries
    no port/host values of its own at all, only the wrapper invocation.
-->
<dict>
	<key>EnvironmentVariables</key>
	<dict>
		<key>CLINE_NO_AUTO_UPDATE</key>
		<string>1</string>
		<key>KANBAN_NO_AUTO_UPDATE</key>
		<string>1</string>
		<key>PATH</key>
		<string>/opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin</string>
	</dict>
	<key>KeepAlive</key>
	<true/>
	<key>Label</key>
	<string>com.ohama.kanban-proxy</string>
	<key>ProgramArguments</key>
	<array>
		<string>/bin/bash</string>
		<string>/Users/ohama/projs/cline-tests/phase-06/net/run_kanban_proxy_service.sh</string>
	</array>
	<key>RunAtLoad</key>
	<true/>
	<key>StandardErrorPath</key>
	<string>/Users/ohama/.cline/logs/kanban-proxy.err</string>
	<key>StandardOutPath</key>
	<string>/Users/ohama/.cline/logs/kanban-proxy.log</string>
	<key>ThrottleInterval</key>
	<integer>30</integer>
	<key>WorkingDirectory</key>
	<string>/Users/ohama/projs/cline-tests/workspace/scratch-repo</string>
</dict>
</plist>
